  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Smoky black, neutral charcoal and white",
    "overview": "SableKit0.1.4 keeps the action grid and compact neutral design, with opaque larger windows, stable tabs, task-oriented main pages and one wider editor with a side preview and guided start.",
